+3. Definitions 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:154: trailing whitespace.
+(a) The index is the total number of data lines (a data line 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:155: trailing whitespace.
+being a 5-octal character uplink word group) in the update. For the 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:156: trailing whitespace.
+state vector update the index must be equal to 1710, transmitted as 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:157: trailing whitespace.
+000213. 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:158: trailing whitespace.
+(b) The quantities beginnin g with the state vector identifier 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:160: trailing whitespace.
+cation specified by the starting address. The address must be in an 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:161: trailing whitespace.
+"ECADR" form. 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:162: trailing whitespace.
+(c) The state vector identifier is used to indicate which 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:163: trailing whitespace.
+vehicle state vector is to be update d and where the coordinate system 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:164: trailing whitespace.
+is centered. This is accomplishe d by setting the identifier to one 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:165: trailing whitespace.
+of the following values. 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:166: trailing whitespace.
+State Vector to Coordinate System Center 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:167: trailing whitespace.
+be updated Earth Moon 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:168: trailing whitespace.
+CSM +1(000013) +2(000023) 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:169: trailing whitespace.
+LM -1(777763) -2(777758) 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:170: trailing whitespace.
+(d) The position and velocity components must be in reference 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:171: trailing whitespace.
+(Besselian) coordinates (may be either geocentric or selenocentric) with 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:172: trailing whitespace.
+the time referenced to the computer clock. 
docs/phase10-evidence/research/luminary_1b_updates.ocr.txt:173: trailing whitespace.
